        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the effort, but yes a new option is almost always the wrong approach.\r\n\r\nWhy did we add `termpastefilter`? The point of `vim.paste` is to be overridable. If overriding `vim.paste` is hard, let's fix that instead of adding a zillion options.",
