        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Why did we add `termpastefilter`?\r\n\r\nAlso why does this remove TAB by default? That is annoying... https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/42433\r\n\r\nFiltering TAB only stops tab-completion in shells that don't use bracketed paste. That doesn't improve \"security\" unless newlines are also filtered.",
